{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And if you say.</b> It is puzzling: what does it say? For what they gathered in the sixth year is to eat in the seventh. Rather, invert the verse, and this is what it says: 'And if you say in the seventh year, what shall we eat' — from here onward."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:29.041362382Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}